{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "mike-study", "elements": [{"id": "3c4b4061a1d840f9a9db", "type": "rectangle", "x": 34, "y": 424, "width": 2352, "height": 375.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 55, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1311274845, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1455645805, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "58f7ae02423f483fbfcf", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 434, "width": 636.9, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 74006548, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1498069041, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "MENYIAPKAN & MENJALANKAN SATU GILIRAN (POST /word-chat)", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "MENYIAPKAN & MENJALANKAN SATU GILIRAN (POST /word-chat)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "7acb9663961a4adfa72d", "type": "rectangle", "x": 34, "y": 834, "width": 2432, "height": 326.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 55, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1521551701, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 758525772, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5d7c8bd3d2a1433c8246", "type": "text", "x": 50, "y": 844, "width": 329.0, "height": 25.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1314036354, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 827943742, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "PENYIMPANAN & ATURAN AKSES", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "PENYIMPANAN & ATURAN AKSES", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "5c8fb591554d403e891e", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 170, "width": 2340, "height": 222.2, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a9d632b48e274041bcf0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 69414877, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1792536038, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "be2e43010ebb42babf8a", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 184, "width": 732.5, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a9d632b48e274041bcf0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 972082924, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1718048063, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Endpoint (semua requireAuth; query document_id = UUID dokumen tertanam, wajib)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Endpoint (semua requireAuth; query document_id = UUID dokumen tertanam, wajib)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "d400850e8d1c4e0faf80", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 215.8, "width": 1293.0, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["a9d632b48e274041bcf0"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1849254197, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1383210631, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "POST   /word-chat                                  → giliran chat (SSE). body: messages, chat_id?, model?, reasoning?, document_context?,\n                                                       document_id, document_name, storage cloud|local, edit_apply_mode, client_tools, time_zone\nGET    /word-chat?document_id&limit(1-100)&offset  → daftar chat dokumen ini milik user (+ project_id: null)\nGET    /word-chat/:chatId                          → chat + pesan + active_turn (giliran yang masih jalan, agar pane yang dibuka ulang menyambung)\nGET    /word-chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stream?from → sambung ulang SSE: frame seq ≥ from diputar ulang, lalu live (diotorisasi dari RUN, bukan baris DB)\nPOST   /word-chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stop        → satu-satunya cara menghentikan jawaban (menutup socket TIDAK menghentikan); 404 turn_not_found\nPATCH  /word-chat/:chatId/model | /reasoning       → simpan pilihan model / reasoning saat dipilih (chat cloud yang sudah ada)\nPUT    /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex   → simpan edit usulan (upsert per message+block_index)\nPATCH  /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex   → hasil terapkan & terima/tolak: apply_status, resolution_status, matched/applied_occurrences, error_*\nPOST   /word-chat/tool-result                       → jawaban tool klien {tool_call_id, result}; 204, atau 404 seragam (tak dikenal/kedaluwarsa/milik orang lain)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "POST   /word-chat                                  → giliran chat (SSE). body: messages, chat_id?, model?, reasoning?, document_context?,\n                                                       document_id, document_name, storage cloud|local, edit_apply_mode, client_tools, time_zone\nGET    /word-chat?document_id&limit(1-100)&offset  → daftar chat dokumen ini milik user (+ project_id: null)\nGET    /word-chat/:chatId                          → chat + pesan + active_turn (giliran yang masih jalan, agar pane yang dibuka ulang menyambung)\nGET    /word-chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stream?from → sambung ulang SSE: frame seq ≥ from diputar ulang, lalu live (diotorisasi dari RUN, bukan baris DB)\nPOST   /word-chat/:chatId/turn/:turnId/stop        → satu-satunya cara menghentikan jawaban (menutup socket TIDAK menghentikan); 404 turn_not_found\nPATCH  /word-chat/:chatId/model | /reasoning       → simpan pilihan model / reasoning saat dipilih (chat cloud yang sudah ada)\nPUT    /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex   → simpan edit usulan (upsert per message+block_index)\nPATCH  /word-chat/messages/:id/edits/:blockIndex   → hasil terapkan & terima/tolak: apply_status, resolution_status, matched/applied_occurrences, error_*\nPOST   /word-chat/tool-result                       → jawaban tool klien {tool_call_id, result}; 204, atau 404 seragam (tak dikenal/kedaluwarsa/milik orang lain)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "f802a67ca50f4d799cd6", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 470, "width": 700, "height": 303.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b387ef37999043c1babd"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 572042516, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1631665245, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "c0c5aeb9faaa49539a42", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 484, "width": 539.1, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b387ef37999043c1babd"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 531528567, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 341262150, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "prepareWordChatStream — urutan (sebelum model dipanggil)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "prepareWordChatStream — urutan (sebelum model dipanggil)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "03f760d2b5164c25ae8c", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 515.8, "width": 283.1, "height": 243.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["b387ef37999043c1babd"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 292202433, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1640710869, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "1 · cek akses playbook yang dilampirkan\n2 · tolak lampiran non-Personal →\n    400 document_workspace_mismatch\n    (juga riwayat chat yang sudah ada)\n3 · [cloud] upsert word_documents\n    (user_id, client_document_id)\n4 · [cloud + chat_id] chat harus milik\n    user & dokumen ini, else 404\n5 · resolveUserChatSelection: model &\n    reasoning (request > chat > setelan user);\n    ubah → UPDATE word_chats\n6 · [cloud, tanpa chat_id] INSERT word_chats;\n    [lokal] chatId = UUID acak, tanpa baris\n7 · [cloud] INSERT pesan user (author_user_id)\n    + pegang giliran memori (fail-open)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "1 · cek akses playbook yang dilampirkan\n2 · tolak lampiran non-Personal →\n    400 document_workspace_mismatch\n    (juga riwayat chat yang sudah ada)\n3 · [cloud] upsert word_documents\n    (user_id, client_document_id)\n4 · [cloud + chat_id] chat harus milik\n    user & dokumen ini, else 404\n5 · resolveUserChatSelection: model &\n    reasoning (request > chat > setelan user);\n    ubah → UPDATE word_chats\n6 · [cloud, tanpa chat_id] INSERT word_chats;\n    [lokal] chatId = UUID acak, tanpa baris\n7 · [cloud] INSERT pesan user (author_user_id)\n    + pegang giliran memori (fail-open)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "2cf8dbb2c25043cda445", "type": "rectangle", "x": 800, "y": 470, "width": 700, "height": 303.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "#ebfbee", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fb5dc5fa8b4e42698443"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1520102158, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1794043412, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "ea1bd988a36049169657", "type": "text", "x": 814, "y": 508.4, "width": 320.8, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#2f9e44", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fb5dc5fa8b4e42698443"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1221872699, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 604971096, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "…lanjutan: merakit konteks & prompt", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "…lanjutan: merakit konteks & prompt", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "faf95923006f44fbb1d6", "type": "text", "x": 814, "y": 540.1, "width": 292.5, "height": 195.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["fb5dc5fa8b4e42698443"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 731419908, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 318115413, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "8 · buildDocContext: lampiran dokumen →\n    docIndex/docStore; dokumen AKTIF Word =\n    entri inline 'inline:word-document:<uuid>'\n    (teks markdown dari pane, bukan file storage)\n9 · nonce spotlight; ulang reasoning model\n    (attachPriorReasoning); enrichWithPriorEvents\n10 · kunci API = milik user (courtlistener\n    DIBUANG); prompt = prompt Word (varian tool\n    vs <EDITS>) + personalisasi user\n11 · buildMessages (waktu kirim, zona waktu),\n    buildWorkflowStore\ngagal di tengah → giliran memori dilepas", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "8 · buildDocContext: lampiran dokumen →\n    docIndex/docStore; dokumen AKTIF Word =\n    entri inline 'inline:word-document:<uuid>'\n    (teks markdown dari pane, bukan file storage)\n9 · nonce spotlight; ulang reasoning model\n    (attachPriorReasoning); enrichWithPriorEvents\n10 · kunci API = milik user (courtlistener\n    DIBUANG); prompt = prompt Word (varian tool\n    vs <EDITS>) + personalisasi user\n11 · buildMessages (waktu kirim, zona waktu),\n    buildWorkflowStore\ngagal di tengah → giliran memori dilepas", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "4ab8e0f144a9455eb4c5", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1540, "y": 470, "width": 820, "height": 303.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "#ffd8a8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4a47d34f8f3a4fb0a3df"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 719713760, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 936791898, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "e048f702ca104c848ab8", "type": "text", "x": 1554, "y": 484, "width": 231.6, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#d9480f", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4a47d34f8f3a4fb0a3df"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 722692541, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1745507050, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Menjalankan giliran (route)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Menjalankan giliran (route)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "696198c24bd44b55a9f6", "type": "text", "x": 1554, "y": 515.8, "width": 361.5, "height": 243.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["4a47d34f8f3a4fb0a3df"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 928765061, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1891654827, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "startAssistantTurnRun(surface 'word') — kunci per chat;\n  sudah ada → 409 turn_in_progress\n[cloud] reserveAssistantMessage: baris assistant\n  dipesan dulu (content null)\nSSE: frame chat_id {chatId, turnId, assistantMessageId}\nrunLLMStream: tanpa riset hukum & tanpa ask_inputs;\n  memori ikut; bila client_tools → adapter tool klien\n  + maxIterations 16 (default 10 terlalu sempit\n  untuk siklus propose→gagal→baca→ulang)\nselesai: normalisasi event edit → persistWordDocumentEdits\n  (baris word_document_edits) → simpan pesan assistant →\n  judul/aktivitas chat → jadwal konsolidasi memori → audit\n  (surface 'word') → [DONE]\nabort: simpan jawaban parsial + frame stop; error: simpan\n  event error & kirim frame error (+ request_id)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "startAssistantTurnRun(surface 'word') — kunci per chat;\n  sudah ada → 409 turn_in_progress\n[cloud] reserveAssistantMessage: baris assistant\n  dipesan dulu (content null)\nSSE: frame chat_id {chatId, turnId, assistantMessageId}\nrunLLMStream: tanpa riset hukum & tanpa ask_inputs;\n  memori ikut; bila client_tools → adapter tool klien\n  + maxIterations 16 (default 10 terlalu sempit\n  untuk siklus propose→gagal→baca→ulang)\nselesai: normalisasi event edit → persistWordDocumentEdits\n  (baris word_document_edits) → simpan pesan assistant →\n  judul/aktivitas chat → jadwal konsolidasi memori → audit\n  (surface 'word') → [DONE]\nabort: simpan jawaban parsial + frame stop; error: simpan\n  event error & kirim frame error (+ request_id)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "66c84736539340ffaa3b", "type": "rectangle", "x": 60, "y": 880, "width": 1160, "height": 254.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "#a5d8ff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3b709b655abe4110b13d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 313413098, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 95378308, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "7ffed4021b4c4a078f51", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 910.2, "width": 401.3, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3b709b655abe4110b13d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1867040422, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2065576689, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Tabel (semua RLS aktif; akses lewat backend)", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Tabel (semua RLS aktif; akses lewat backend)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "138dab97e3bb4672bc5e", "type": "text", "x": 74, "y": 942.0, "width": 819.1, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["3b709b655abe4110b13d"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1705098190, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1438678181, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "word_documents     id · user_id · client_document_id · unique(user, client_document_id)\n  └─ word_chats    word_document_id · user_id · title · model · reasoning_level(none…max)\n       └─ word_chat_messages  chat_id · author_user_id · role user|assistant · content jsonb (event)\n            files · workflow · playbook · citations (jsonb) · kolom kelayakan memori\n            └─ word_document_edits  unique(message, block_index) · original_text ≥1 · replacement_text\n                 formats[] · occurrence 'all'|null · reason · apply_mode direct|approval\n                 apply_status proposed|applied|unmanaged|failed · resolution_status accepted|rejected\n                 CHECK: resolution hanya bila apply_status='applied' · matched/applied_occurrences\n                 error_code/message · applied_at · resolved_at\ndihapus berantai (ON DELETE CASCADE) bila user dihapus; terpisah dari chats/chat_messages web", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 3, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "word_documents     id · user_id · client_document_id · unique(user, client_document_id)\n  └─ word_chats    word_document_id · user_id · title · model · reasoning_level(none…max)\n       └─ word_chat_messages  chat_id · author_user_id · role user|assistant · content jsonb (event)\n            files · workflow · playbook · citations (jsonb) · kolom kelayakan memori\n            └─ word_document_edits  unique(message, block_index) · original_text ≥1 · replacement_text\n                 formats[] · occurrence 'all'|null · reason · apply_mode direct|approval\n                 apply_status proposed|applied|unmanaged|failed · resolution_status accepted|rejected\n                 CHECK: resolution hanya bila apply_status='applied' · matched/applied_occurrences\n                 error_code/message · applied_at · resolved_at\ndihapus berantai (ON DELETE CASCADE) bila user dihapus; terpisah dari chats/chat_messages web", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "40bdd280281d453fa97f", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1260, "y": 880, "width": 640, "height": 254.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "#d0bfff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c95ef2c3f52247038df8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 979239441, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1023054481, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "6aa3f6cbe22b46db9cab", "type": "text", "x": 1274, "y": 894, "width": 248.0, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#6741d9", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c95ef2c3f52247038df8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1492378764, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2140677244, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Penyimpanan: cloud vs lokal", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Penyimpanan: cloud vs lokal", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "c7f2cfcd804b4882a65c", "type": "text", "x": 1274, "y": 925.8, "width": 294.8, "height": 195.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["c95ef2c3f52247038df8"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1165880412, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1197002399, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "cloud: semua di atas disimpan; riwayat lintas\n  perangkat; edit & hasilnya tahan ditutup pane\nlokal (storage:'local'): TIDAK ADA baris —\n  transkrip & edit di IndexedDB peramban Word\n  (word-chats, word-chat-messages,\n  word-document-edits); server tetap menjalankan\n  giliran + membuat run yang bisa disambung\n  (kunci = chatId UUID), otorisasi dari run:\n  user + document_id\naudit lokal: tak menyimpan prompt, hanya\n  'giliran Word terjadi' + nama dokumen\npreferensi gagal dibaca → fail-closed ke lokal", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "cloud: semua di atas disimpan; riwayat lintas\n  perangkat; edit & hasilnya tahan ditutup pane\nlokal (storage:'local'): TIDAK ADA baris —\n  transkrip & edit di IndexedDB peramban Word\n  (word-chats, word-chat-messages,\n  word-document-edits); server tetap menjalankan\n  giliran + membuat run yang bisa disambung\n  (kunci = chatId UUID), otorisasi dari run:\n  user + document_id\naudit lokal: tak menyimpan prompt, hanya\n  'giliran Word terjadi' + nama dokumen\npreferensi gagal dibaca → fail-closed ke lokal", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "afc5af91a4a045ff9b0a", "type": "rectangle", "x": 1940, "y": 880, "width": 500, "height": 254.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "#ffec99", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["56570fed12a0468db373"], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1433505479, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1408093886, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false}, {"id": "5a45aefd800f4397b5ba", "type": "text", "x": 1954, "y": 910.2, "width": 233.9, "height": 23.8, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#e67700", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["56570fed12a0468db373"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 1109217154, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1051189869, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Identitas dokumen & guard", "fontSize": 19, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Identitas dokumen & guard", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "533160dc9bf543dcb090", "type": "text", "x": 1954, "y": 942.0, "width": 304.5, "height": 162.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": ["56570fed12a0468db373"], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 2042023351, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 675475039, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "document_id = UUID dalam setelan dokumen\n  Office (client-side); Save As → identitas baru\ndaftar/ambil chat selalu disaring user_id +\n  word_document_id → chat dokumen lain/user lain\n  = 404 'Chat not found'\nWord hanya Personal workspace: tak ada\n  tujuan organisasi di model data\ntool-result: 404 seragam (cegah menebak id)\nframe client_tool_call diputar ulang hanya bila\n  masih pending (cegah edit ganda)", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "document_id = UUID dalam setelan dokumen\n  Office (client-side); Save As → identitas baru\ndaftar/ambil chat selalu disaring user_id +\n  word_document_id → chat dokumen lain/user lain\n  = 404 'Chat not found'\nWord hanya Personal workspace: tak ada\n  tujuan organisasi di model data\ntool-result: 404 seragam (cegah menebak id)\nframe client_tool_call diputar ulang hanya bila\n  masih pending (cegah edit ganda)", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "ca06b9d441e7407c90d4", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 20, "width": 1466.3, "height": 37.5, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 401970013, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1101639285, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "Word add-in D — sisi server: endpoint /word-chat, penyiapan giliran, tabel, dan penyimpanan cloud vs lokal", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Word add-in D — sisi server: endpoint /word-chat, penyiapan giliran, tabel, dan penyimpanan cloud vs lokal", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.25}, {"id": "69dc136eb73c4c9992a5", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 66, "width": 940.4, "height": 20.0, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "seed": 551764343, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 1702789700, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": null, "updated": 1793419178438, "link": null, "locked": false, "text": "backend/src/modules/word-chat/{wordChat.routes.ts, wordChat.service.ts} · schema.sql (word_*) · streamRuns · wordClientTools", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "backend/src/modules/word-chat/{wordChat.routes.ts, wordChat.service.t